  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/768",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: start;\">안녕하세요,</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">재과만에서 여러 선생님들께 많은 도움을 받고 있어 항상 감사드립니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">숏츠를 보다가 수업에 활용할까 해서 소개해드립니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">수업 마무리 단계에서 활용하면 좋을 것 같습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">illusion diffusion 이라고 다른 그림에 자신이 원하는 그림이나 문자를 넣을 수 있습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p>1. Illusion Diffusion 사이트 : <a href=\"https://illusiondiffusion.net/\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://illusiondiffusion.net/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Illusion Diffusion\" data-og-description=\"Illusion Diffusion AI is an online photo(face) ai optical Illusion image generator that allows you to create eye-catching optical Illusion art. Try it now!\" data-og-host=\"illusiondiffusion.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://illusiondiffusion.net/\" data-og-url=\"https://illusiondiffusion.net\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Faq1R/hyVZiXR4NB/FfXGw9EnfcbSbd66mHlYS1/img.jpg?width=1080&amp;height=810&amp;face=16_101_387_506,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/o2LAd/hyVZtLUcFt/AZJ71fAEroaAoyNimWjivK/img.jpg?width=1080&amp;height=810&amp;face=16_101_387_506,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bbJ6dr/hyVZltyWti/AXuOpfUmLEkbEo0Tc6qo8K/img.png?width=872&amp;height=864&amp;face=286_245_585_572\"><a href=\"https://illusiondiffusion.net/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://illusiondiffusion.net/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Faq1R/hyVZiXR4NB/FfXGw9EnfcbSbd66mHlYS1/img.jpg?width=1080&amp;height=810&amp;face=16_101_387_506,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/o2LAd/hyVZtLUcFt/AZJ71fAEroaAoyNimWjivK/img.jpg?width=1080&amp;height=810&amp;face=16_101_387_506,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bbJ6dr/hyVZltyWti/AXuOpfUmLEkbEo0Tc6qo8K/img.png?width=872&amp;height=864&amp;face=286_245_585_572\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Illusion Diffusion</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Illusion Diffusion AI is an online photo(face) ai optical Illusion image generator that allows you to create eye-catching optical Illusion art. Try it now!</p><p class=\"og-host\">illusiondiffusion.net</p></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0680271623b29d84c63dac4b49b2eee896acdb9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0680271623b29d84c63dac4b49b2eee896acdb9\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"568\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">아쉽게도 유료로 이용이 가능합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p>2. hugging face :&#160;<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://huggingface.co/spaces</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Spaces - Hugging Face\" data-og-description=\"Running on CPU Upgrade\" data-og-host=\"huggingface.co\" data-og-source-url=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces\" data-og-url=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/9o8xl/hyVZftkxqN/wWtKaF9WCY1fmadnGQn3h0/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=648&amp;face=0_0_1200_648\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/9o8xl/hyVZftkxqN/wWtKaF9WCY1fmadnGQn3h0/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=648&amp;face=0_0_1200_648\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Spaces - Hugging Face</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Running on CPU Upgrade</p><p class=\"og-host\">huggingface.co</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6f9e361e66d6d54ab65f4eb6992b29c7e6a0f9c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6f9e361e66d6d54ab65f4eb6992b29c7e6a0f9c\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"343\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">hugging face 에서&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">illusion diffusion을 이용하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fdeb1134319fe89358759bfcf2e0c0d076cb0145\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fdeb1134319fe89358759bfcf2e0c0d076cb0145\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"646\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e959f80ee2151a6dc81b133ffb2395eb61a5f2b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"446\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e959f80ee2151a6dc81b133ffb2395eb61a5f2b\" data-origin-width=\"753\" data-origin-height=\"721\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">strength가 낮을수록 글자가 흐릿하게 보입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">학생들에게 퀴즈로 내려면&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">0.75 ~ 0.85 정도가 적당할 것 같습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">혹은 프롬프트에 따라 조절하면 됩니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p><b>결과물</b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e27086be1379efc30b66b3e0f94cdfab1889d17\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e27086be1379efc30b66b3e0f94cdfab1889d17\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div></td><td><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b5413a8c766325be527243a359d2504424bd5125\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b5413a8c766325be527243a359d2504424bd5125\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6fd64bd3b99bd50b3fa2d47a8befcc87df4ebe76\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6fd64bd3b99bd50b3fa2d47a8befcc87df4ebe76\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div></td><td><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1d35f4579d97fd4e8448c50099d58b078ebb6e2c\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1d35f4579d97fd4e8448c50099d58b078ebb6e2c\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">프롬프트는 챗GPT에게 부탁합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">검색어 : 지브리 스타일 그림 프롬프트, 영어로</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bbb11ec98c8bfe2363f678cd9700e2f06dadaaeb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bbb11ec98c8bfe2363f678cd9700e2f06dadaaeb\" data-origin-width=\"849\" data-origin-height=\"696\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e8c9e81bdfb84f7dabf3b000ab1420d41da7af4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"460\" height=\"460\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e8c9e81bdfb84f7dabf3b000ab1420d41da7af4\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"><div class=\"figcaption\">감사합니다!</div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
